# Player car 1, first sheet. PDF page 13, block G.
# Written like a MAME netlist: chips by location, then each wire as the pins it joins.
# tools/generate_netlist.py names the Verilog wires from the pins: docs/NET_NAMES.md.
chip J2 7408
chip H1 74112
chip F1 7410
chip E1 74193
chip D1 7486
chip F3 7404
chip K1 7420
chip J1 74112
chip H2 7408
# Fixed 2026-11-05: K2.2 meets the 5GTHB/5HTHB line feeding GRSC/HRSC. Death Race 5U/5H agree. J and K are then complementary.
chip K2 74112
chip G1 7407
chip J3 7400
chip J4 74193
prom H3 82S129 92
prom G2 82S123 35
chip H4 74161
chip G3 74161
chip F2 74161

# Wires: drawing label, then every pin it joins on this sheet. BOARD marks a
# wire that rtl/deathrac_board.v drives or reads. GND/VCC are tied pins, OPEN a
# visibly floating input, NC a drawn output stub that goes nowhere.
net GTWS J2.3 H1.3
net MTTB J2.1 BOARD
net MTTA J2.2 BOARD
net GTWR J2.6 H1.2
net 5MTTB J2.4
net 5MTTA J2.5
net 2PQ07 H1.1 H1.13 J1.1
net G999 H1.4 H1.10 H1.14 J1.15 J1.10 J1.14 K2.4 K2.15 J4.10 J4.9 G3.1 G3.5 G3.6 G3.10 F2.1 F2.5 F2.6 F2.10 BOARD
net GTWA H1.5 H1.11 F1.5 F1.9
net 5GTWA H1.6 H1.12
net 1ESGC H1.15 H4.1
net NC H1.9 E1.13 E1.12 K2.5 J4.13 J4.12 H4.11 H4.12 H4.13 H4.14 G3.11 G3.12 G3.13 G3.14 F2.11 F2.12 F2.13 F2.14
net 5GTWB H1.7 F1.4 F1.10
net 6GQLT F1.6 E1.4
net MTNL F1.3
net 6GQRT F1.8 E1.5
net MTNR F1.11
net 5ECDG E1.11
net GND E1.14 E1.15 E1.1 E1.10 E1.9 J4.15 J4.1 H3.13 H3.14 G2.14 G2.15
net GCT0 E1.3 G2.10
net GCT1 E1.2 G2.11
net GCT2 E1.6 F3.11 G2.12
net GCT3 E1.7 D1.2 G2.13
net GGT3 D1.3 D1.5
